+### Auto-research
+
+Find passages that need sources, then search for one target:
+
+```sh
+twyne research targets (--folio ID | --file FILE | --stdin) [--strategy hosted|model] [--max N] [--brief FILE] [--existing "Title A" --existing "Title B"] [--json]
